    "updated_at": "2016-12-14T23:08:36Z",
    "body": "This is a big rough, but the structure matches exactly what I found myself having to do in https://codereview.chromium.org/2573773002/ in order to make sense of fully exit fullscreen with the timing changes to modify the fullscreen element stack (soon top layer) at animation frame timing.\r\n\r\nI have doubts about whether to expose this in the API or not. It would be great for testing and I even have the tests, but is it also useful for web authors?",
