    "body": "I have reworked and rebased this on top of https://github.com/whatwg/fullscreen/pull/81, which gets rid of some of the changes I had. It's not really possible to write tests for \"fully exit fullscreen\" with web-exposed APIs currently AFAIK, I have two tests in Blink that depend on something funny about window.open that I don't think is per spec.\r\n\r\nSo, I think testing the algorithm is blocked on https://github.com/whatwg/fullscreen/issues/70 and will file a wpt issue about missing test coverage.",
